@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">The Re-Waste Mission</h1>
    <p>
        Our mission is to help people better understand what they can do with their old tech. We hope to encourage environmentally and socially conscious disposal of old devices.
        Re-Waste is designed to allow us to help users dispose of their tech by taking stress and hassle of researching disposal options away. 
        We believe that taking some of the hassle away will make it easier to get rid of old devices properly, and therefore encourage more people to sell, repair, donate or recycle their old devices.
    </p>

    <h2> The Re-Waste Team</h2>

    <p>
        We are students studying Software Development, and AI and Data Science at Glasgow Caledonian University. This project is for our group project module.
    </p>

</div>
